</span></span></td>
<td id="S5.T13.4.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:2.6pt;padding-right:2.6pt;">Seed-TTS<sub id="S5.T13.4.3.2.1" class="ltx_sub">ICL</sub> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib3" title="" class="ltx_ref">Anastassiou et al., 2024</a>)</cite></td>
<td id="S5.T13.4.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:2.6pt;padding-right:2.6pt;">1.11 — 2.24</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T13.4.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T13.4.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:2.6pt;padding-right:2.6pt;">Seed-TTS<sub id="S5.T13.4.4.1.1" class="ltx_sub">RL</sub> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib3" title="" class="ltx_ref">Anastassiou et al., 2024</a>)</cite></td>
<td id="S5.T13.4.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:2.6pt;padding-right:2.6pt;">1.00 — 1.94</td></tr>
